<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets A$100 mln Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets A$100 mln Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN</p>
<p> AMT	  A$100 MLN COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
